#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/rust-and-c.md:19
msgid ""
"Errors: Must convert `Result` to abide by C conventions; easy to forget to "
"check errors on C side."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/rust-and-c.md:22
msgid ""
"Strings: Conversion cost; null bytes in Rust strings cause truncation; UTF-8 "
"validation on ingress."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/rust-and-c.md:25
msgid ""
"Nullability: Every pointer from C must be checked to create an "
"`Option<NonNull<T>>`, implying unsafe blocks or runtime cost."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/rust-and-c.md:28
msgid "Ownership: Must document and enforce object lifetimes manually."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/rust-and-c.md:30
msgid ""
"Callbacks: Must decompose closures into fn pointer + context; lifetime of "
"context is manual."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/rust-and-c.md:33
msgid ""
"Panics: Panic across FFI boundary is undefined behavior; must catch at "
"boundary with `catch_unwind`."
msgstr ""
